  "description": "A dependency-free .NET 10 library for generating and verifying post-quantum digital signatures with ML-DSA (Module-Lattice-Based Digital Signature Algorithm), standardized by NIST in FIPS 204. Supports ML-DSA-44, ML-DSA-65, and ML-DSA-87, including key generation, PEM/DER/certificate loading, import/export, managed software keys, and Windows CNG/NCrypt HSM keys.",
